{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受描写不如Y细密，尤其削弱了部分随音乐推进的微妙情绪变化和具体音乐细节。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏让人容易先抓住人物叙事，再扫读对应感受；而且人物每一步为什么犹豫、期待、退缩，交代得更完整，前后心理变化也更容易串起来。Y的高亮关键词确实更容易抓住段落要点，感受词与音乐时点的对应也更细腻，但部分描写重复、意象过密，实际观看时容易分散注意力。综合边听边看的体验，我更愿意选X，虽然它牺牲了一些Y所保留的细微层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "30f43f0e-8bea-4790-8e03-c49d43dd5064", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T074911709365Z", "elapsed_seconds": 105.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:50:56.725140+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f9697d30a2f328b2c4c2bbfd5d65b0747fd4741fb6c3dc1d877a27ea3b3d4f77", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885